// `koruc <file> glance` is the declaration surface of the program — but on a
// hello world it lists ~15 modules the program never imported: std.compiler's
// pipeline internals (coordinate, elaborate, emission), std.optimizer,
// std.rules, std.template. The injected compiler env is presented
// indistinguishably from declarations the author made — a user cannot tell
// what their program declares from what the machine rides inside it.

~import std/io

~tor main {}

~proc main|zig {
}

~main()
